window.__code__["token-usage-model-wrapper-py-15"] = {"code_id": "token-usage-model-wrapper-py-15", "kind": "src", "title": "model_wrapper.py:15", "source_path": "QwenPaw-main/src/qwenpaw/token_usage/model_wrapper.py", "highlight_line": 15, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Model wrapper that records token usage from LLM responses.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> datetime <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> date, datetime, timezone</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> typing <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Any, AsyncGenerator, Literal</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> agentscope.model <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> ChatModelBase</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> agentscope.model._model_response <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> ChatResponse</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> agentscope.model._model_usage <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> ChatUsage</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> .buffer <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> _UsageEvent</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> .manager <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> get_token_usage_manager</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> TokenRecordingModelWrapper(ChatModelBase):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Wraps a ChatModelBase to record token usage on each call.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\">    _usage_by_session: dict[str, dict[str, Any]] = {}</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __init__(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">        provider_id: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\">        model: ChatModelBase,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\">        compact_threshold: float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># agentscope 2.0 ChatModelBase requires credential/model/parameters.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Forward the wrapped model&#x27;s own values so the base attributes stay</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># consistent (some downstream code reads ``self.model`` for logging).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">        super().__init__(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">            credential=getattr(model, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;credential&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\">            model=getattr(model, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;model&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;unknown&quot;</span>),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\">            parameters=getattr(model, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;parameters&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> ChatModelBase.Parameters(),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\">            stream=getattr(model, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;stream&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\">            context_size=getattr(model, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;context_size&quot;</span>, 32768),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._model = model</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._provider_id = provider_id</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Auto-compaction threshold (fraction of the window) for the UI, or</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># None when compaction is disabled/unknown.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._compact_threshold = compact_threshold</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"43\"><span class=\"c-no\">43</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _record_usage(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, usage: ChatUsage | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"44\"><span class=\"c-no\">44</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Enqueue a usage event synchronously — never blocks the caller.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"45\"><span class=\"c-no\">45</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> usage <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"46\"><span class=\"c-no\">46</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"47\"><span class=\"c-no\">47</span><span class=\"c-src\">        pt = getattr(usage, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;input_tokens&quot;</span>, 0) <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> 0</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"48\"><span class=\"c-no\">48</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ct = getattr(usage, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;output_tokens&quot;</span>, 0) <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> 0</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"49\"><span class=\"c-no\">49</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> pt &lt;= 0 <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> ct &lt;= 0:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"50\"><span class=\"c-no\">50</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"51\"><span class=\"c-no\">51</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"52\"><span class=\"c-no\">52</span><span class=\"c-src\">        event = _UsageEvent(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"53\"><span class=\"c-no\">53</span><span class=\"c-src\">            provider_id=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._provider_id,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"54\"><span class=\"c-no\">54</span><span class=\"c-src\">            model_name=<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.model,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"55\"><span class=\"c-no\">55</span><span class=\"c-src\">            prompt_tokens=pt,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"56\"><span class=\"c-no\">56</span><span class=\"c-src\">            completion_tokens=ct,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"57\"><span class=\"c-no\">57</span><span class=\"c-src\">            date_str=date.today().isoformat(),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"58\"><span class=\"c-no\">58</span><span class=\"c-src\">            now_iso=datetime.now(tz=timezone.utc).isoformat(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"59\"><span class=\"c-no\">59</span><span class=\"c-src\">                timespec=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;seconds&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"60\"><span class=\"c-no\">60</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"61\"><span class=\"c-no\">61</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"62\"><span class=\"c-no\">62</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Fire-and-forget: synchronous put_nowait, ~100 ns, no await needed.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"63\"><span class=\"c-no\">63</span><span class=\"c-src\">        get_token_usage_manager().enqueue(event)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"64\"><span class=\"c-no\">64</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"65\"><span class=\"c-no\">65</span><span class=\"c-src\">        usage_data = {</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"66\"><span class=\"c-no\">66</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;provider_id&quot;</span>: <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._provider_id,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"67\"><span class=\"c-no\">67</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;model_name&quot;</span>: <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.model,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"68\"><span class=\"c-no\">68</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;prompt_tokens&quot;</span>: pt,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"69\"><span class=\"c-no\">69</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;completion_tokens&quot;</span>: ct,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"70\"><span class=\"c-no\">70</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;total_tokens&quot;</span>: pt + ct,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"71\"><span class=\"c-no\">71</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># Context window of the wrapped model, so the UI can show how full</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"72\"><span class=\"c-no\">72</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># the *current* context is (prompt_tokens / context_size), distinct</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"73\"><span class=\"c-no\">73</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># from the cumulative session totals. 0 = unknown.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"74\"><span class=\"c-no\">74</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;context_size&quot;</span>: int(getattr(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._model, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;context_size&quot;</span>, 0) <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> 0),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"75\"><span class=\"c-no\">75</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># Auto-compaction threshold (fraction of the window) so the UI can</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"76\"><span class=\"c-no\">76</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># mark where context gets evicted. None = disabled/unknown.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"77\"><span class=\"c-no\">77</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;compact_threshold&quot;</span>: <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._compact_threshold,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"78\"><span class=\"c-no\">78</span><span class=\"c-src\">        }</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"79\"><span class=\"c-no\">79</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._store_usage(usage_data)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"80\"><span class=\"c-no\">80</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"81\"><span class=\"c-no\">81</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @classmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"82\"><span class=\"c-no\">82</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> pop_usage_for_session(cls, session_id: str) -&gt; dict[str, Any] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"83\"><span class=\"c-no\">83</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> cls._usage_by_session.pop(session_id, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"84\"><span class=\"c-no\">84</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"85\"><span class=\"c-no\">85</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _store_usage(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, usage: dict[str, Any] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"86\"><span class=\"c-no\">86</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ..app.agent_context <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> get_current_session_id</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"87\"><span class=\"c-no\">87</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"88\"><span class=\"c-no\">88</span><span class=\"c-src\">        session_id = get_current_session_id()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"89\"><span class=\"c-no\">89</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> session_id <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> usage:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"90\"><span class=\"c-no\">90</span><span class=\"c-src\">            TokenRecordingModelWrapper._usage_by_session[session_id] = usage</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"91\"><span class=\"c-no\">91</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"92\"><span class=\"c-no\">92</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> generate_structured_output(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"93\"><span class=\"c-no\">93</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"94\"><span class=\"c-no\">94</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *args: Any,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"95\"><span class=\"c-no\">95</span><span class=\"c-src\">        **kwargs: Any,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"96\"><span class=\"c-no\">96</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; Any:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"97\"><span class=\"c-no\">97</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._model.generate_structured_output(*args, **kwargs)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"98\"><span class=\"c-no\">98</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._record_usage(getattr(result, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;usage&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"99\"><span class=\"c-no\">99</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> result</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"100\"><span class=\"c-no\">100</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"101\"><span class=\"c-no\">101</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> __call__(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"102\"><span class=\"c-no\">102</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"103\"><span class=\"c-no\">103</span><span class=\"c-src\">        messages: list[dict],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"104\"><span class=\"c-no\">104</span><span class=\"c-src\">        tools: list[dict] | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"105\"><span class=\"c-no\">105</span><span class=\"c-src\">        tool_choice: Literal[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;auto&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;none&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;required&quot;</span>] | str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"106\"><span class=\"c-no\">106</span><span class=\"c-src\">        **kwargs: Any,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"107\"><span class=\"c-no\">107</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; ChatResponse | AsyncGenerator[ChatResponse, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"108\"><span class=\"c-no\">108</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># agentscope 2.0 routes structured output through</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"109\"><span class=\"c-no\">109</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># ``generate_structured_output`` instead of a ``__call__`` kwarg, and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"110\"><span class=\"c-no\">110</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># provider SDKs (anthropic, openai) reject unknown kwargs. Drop the</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"111\"><span class=\"c-no\">111</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># 1.x ``structured_model`` if a caller still passes it.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"112\"><span class=\"c-no\">112</span><span class=\"c-src\">        kwargs.pop(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;structured_model&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"113\"><span class=\"c-no\">113</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"114\"><span class=\"c-no\">114</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># Fix: Omit tool_choice=\u000047\u0000 for vLLM compatibility</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"115\"><span class=\"c-no\">115</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># vLLM without --enable-auto-tool-choice will reject requests when</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"116\"><span class=\"c-no\">116</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># tool_choice=\u000050\u0000 is present, even if tools are provided.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"117\"><span class=\"c-no\">117</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># By omitting tool_choice when it&#x27;s \u000052\u0000, we bypass the check</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"118\"><span class=\"c-no\">118</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># while keeping tools available for correct tool calling behavior.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"119\"><span class=\"c-no\">119</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> tool_choice == <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;auto&quot;</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"120\"><span class=\"c-no\">120</span><span class=\"c-src\">            tool_choice = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"121\"><span class=\"c-no\">121</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"122\"><span class=\"c-no\">122</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._model(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"123\"><span class=\"c-no\">123</span><span class=\"c-src\">            messages=messages,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"124\"><span class=\"c-no\">124</span><span class=\"c-src\">            tools=tools,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"125\"><span class=\"c-no\">125</span><span class=\"c-src\">            tool_choice=tool_choice,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"126\"><span class=\"c-no\">126</span><span class=\"c-src\">            **kwargs,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"127\"><span class=\"c-no\">127</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"128\"><span class=\"c-no\">128</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"129\"><span class=\"c-no\">129</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> isinstance(result, AsyncGenerator):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"130\"><span class=\"c-no\">130</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._wrap_stream(result)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"131\"><span class=\"c-no\">131</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._record_usage(getattr(result, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;usage&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"132\"><span class=\"c-no\">132</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> result</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"133\"><span class=\"c-no\">133</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"134\"><span class=\"c-no\">134</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _wrap_stream(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"135\"><span class=\"c-no\">135</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"136\"><span class=\"c-no\">136</span><span class=\"c-src\">        stream: AsyncGenerator[ChatResponse, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"137\"><span class=\"c-no\">137</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; AsyncGenerator[ChatResponse, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"138\"><span class=\"c-no\">138</span><span class=\"c-src\">        last_usage: ChatUsage | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"139\"><span class=\"c-no\">139</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> chunk <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> stream:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"140\"><span class=\"c-no\">140</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> getattr(chunk, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;usage&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>) <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"141\"><span class=\"c-no\">141</span><span class=\"c-src\">                last_usage = chunk.usage</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"142\"><span class=\"c-no\">142</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">yield</span> chunk</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"143\"><span class=\"c-no\">143</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._record_usage(last_usage)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"144\"><span class=\"c-no\">144</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 144, "explanation": "TokenRecordingModelWrapper 包装 ChatModelBase，每次 __call__ 记录 token 用量。配合 TokenUsageManager 聚合统计、buffer 缓冲、storage 持久化、turn_usage 按轮统计。与 BudgetGate 联动实现超预算熔断。对应 JD『Token 消耗监控』。", "knowledge_points": [{"title": "可观测性", "body": "TracingMiddleware 出 agent/llm/tool 三类 OTel span；TokenRecordingModelWrapper 包装模型记 token；TokenUsageManager 聚合；Langfuse 产品侧看板；Budget gate 熔断。"}], "related_docs": ["W10-Loop-Engineering与治理沙箱安全", "W12-多Agent协作平台实战(下)-毕业交付", "08-可观测性"]};
